      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but i think it's a little too \"dry\" for a donor appeal. it feels a bit like a news report rather than something people want to connect with emotionally.\n\ncan we try another version? i'm looking for something that feels a bit more heartfelt and hopeful. i just ran your draft through our sentiment tool and the positivity score was actually pretty low—it's mostly highlighting the bad stuff. we need people to feel like their donation is part of a beautiful, life-giving solution. \n\ncan you rewrite it to be more inspiring and emotionally resonant? again, just please don't go overboard with the \"drama\" or use a ton of empty adjectives just to pump the score. i just need it to actually move people.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
